sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Caller
  participant P1 as Service
  participant P2 as Worker
  participant P3 as Provider
  P0->>P1: Create notification intent
  P1->>P0: 202 durable acceptance
  P1->>P2: Deliver queued intent
  P2->>P3: Send with stable key
  P3-->>P2: Temporary failure
  P2->>P3: Retry under deadline
  P3->>P1: Signed delivery callback
  P1->>P0: Status query result
